    pros: [
      "Linear ball bearings on steel shafts, usually the smoothest sled guidance",
      "Limited lifetime frame, three-year moving parts and one-year pad warranty",
      "Light 55 lb starting sled and five racking positions",
      "A 28 by 25 inch hack squat platform, per Bells of Steel",
    ],
    cons: [
      "We found no independent review of this version to check figures against",
      "At 87 inches long it needs a longer room than Titan’s dedicated sled",
      "Bells of Steel’s stated fit tops out at 6 ft 2 in",
    ],
    bottomLine: "The combo to buy for the warranty and the bearings, if you are comfortable relying on the maker’s figures.",
    description: "Bells of Steel's combo does hack squats, leg presses and calf raises on a sled that rides linear ball bearings. Every figure here is Bells of Steel's: a 55 lb starting sled, a 1,000 lb capacity in every mode, an 87 by 37.5 by 58 inch frame, a 322 lb machine, five racking positions, multiple footplate angles, band pegs, a 28 by 25 inch hack squat platform and a 26 by 13.75 inch leg press footplate. Bells of Steel says it has fitted lifters from 5 ft 0 in to 6 ft 2 in and 265 lb. The warranty is a limited lifetime on the frame, three years on moving parts and one year on the back pad. Independent coverage we found was of Bells of Steel's separate, larger Iso Leg Press and Hack Squat, which Garage Gym Reviews describes as smooth on its guide rods but expensive. Bells of Steel listed it at $2,053.99 on its own store on 19 October 2026, and by November 2026 it was also listed on Amazon US. It takes the slot the Force USA Compact Leg Press & Hack Squat held on this page; Force USA sells the Compact on its own store, not on Amazon, and this is the closest combo we could check that is.",
  },
  {
    id: "body-solid-glph1100b-hack",
    name: "Body-Solid GLPH1100B Leg Press & Hack Squat",
    brand: "Body-Solid",
    category: "Plate-loaded hack squat and leg press combo, light commercial",
    badge: "Best Pads",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0028O9ADE?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41idQQCQJCL._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":500},
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "$1,735–$2,200",
    priceBounds: {"low":1735,"high":2200},
